  "title": "Polenta Lasagna Loaf",
  "description": "Twice-cooked polenta stands in for noodles in Chef John&#39;s lasagna loaf that can be served straight from the pan or inverted onto a platter for a nicer presentation.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-03-15T09:00:00-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2023-07-19T11:28:31-04:00",
