    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make polenta lasagna loaf using layers of polenta, a cheese filling, and pasta sauce. To start, mix together and refrigerate the polenta before cutting it into four even rectangles. Mix together the cheese filling using ingredients like ricotta, parmesan, mozzarella, seasoning, and a beaten egg. Finally, layer the polenta with the cheese filling and pasta sauce into a loaf pan and bake it in the oven. The final result is a sweet, yet fluffy dish that tastes like lasagna and is perfect for an Italian dinner.",
